#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:988
msgid "There seem to be issues with the Wayland Display Server and wxWidgets.  WxMaxima may be affected, e.g. that sidebars are not moveable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
